@startuml
title ATM State Machine for Withdrawal

[*] --> SelectAmount

state "SelectAmount" as SelectAmount
state "EnterCustomValue"
state "VerifyTransaction"
state "RejectedAmount"
state "ReturnCard"

SelectAmount --> EnterCustomValue : select from options
EnterCustomValue --> VerifyTransaction : valid input
EnterCustomValue --> RejectedAmount : invalid input

VerifyTransaction --> ReturnCard : approved / dispense cash
VerifyTransaction --> RejectedAmount : rejected / prompt user to re-enter amount

RejectedAmount --> SelectAmount
ReturnCard --> [*] : return card
@enduml
